@title An option the project does not have is a refusal triangle, not a toast
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# T10c: machine option refusals use the refuse API: a triangle on the canvas corner that goes with the next input.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option nosuchoption
wait 4
key Enter
wait 12
shot option-refusal
check_layout
